body:
I can see why it happens. A quick fix is to remove the most outer data structure named `template_testlocations` and directly start with `template` like this:

```
{
        "template": "locations*",
        "mappings": {
            "locations": {
                "_source": {
                    "compress": true
                },
                "_all": {
                    "enabled": false
                },
                "properties": {
                    "contactPersonId" : {
                        "index_analyzer": "keyword",
                        "type" : "string"
                    },
                    "state": {
                        "index_analyzer": "keyword",
                        "type": "string"
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    }
```
